          "text": "Autumn Stories (Project Overview)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Executive Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is **Autumn Stories Sample**, a sophisticated interactive storytelling web application built with Nuxt 3. The application presents immersive, scroll-driven narratives about community development projects, specifically focusing on Baltimore's York Road investment initiative, MCCEI impact reporting, and legacy storytelling. It features a New York Times-style scrollytelling interface with synchronized visual and textual content, interactive maps, animated data visualizations, and video content."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Technology Stack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Primary Language**: TypeScript/JavaScript"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Framework**: Nuxt 3.17.4 (Vue.js-based)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**UI Library**: Nuxt UI 3.1.3 with Tailwind CSS"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Database**: None (static content application)"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Key Libraries**:"
